'''Corruption of the Awakener''' is a stackable [[debuff]] that is applied by the [[Sirus, Awakener of Worlds#Attacks|Spinning Beams]] during the final phase of [[Sirus, Awakener of Worlds]] boss fight.
==Trivia==
The status icon uses the same graphic with the debuff from monsters that are possessed by the {{il|Remnant of Corruption}}.
